## Task Metadata Limits

Check **all** fields. Actual verdict and fixability follow the current form and current guidelines — do **not** use the old rule that only four metadata fields can ever matter for validity.

| Field / rule | Limit / expectation |
|--------------|---------------------|
| `cpus` | 2 or 4 |
| `memory_mb` | 2048 to 16384 |
| `storage_mb` | 5120 to 10240 |
| `gpus` | always 0 |
| `build_timeout_sec` | maximum 1800 |
| `agent.timeout_sec` | maximum 3600 |
| `verifier.timeout_sec` | maximum 1800 |
| `network_mode` | **Remove** if present |
| `allowed_hosts` | **Remove** if present |
| category | Check accuracy |
| difficulty explanation | Check accuracy |
| source URL | Check resolves to correct PR/commit/issue |

Also review language, tags, time estimates, and related metadata as observations when present. Packaging judges may cross-check metadata against task content.

